 will [c][cc0011]lose[-][/c] if your Fever bar is empty","flow":true},{"text":"The [c][cc0011]rank[-][/c] and [c][cc0011]accuracy[-][/c] for the play: Your rank will become higher if your accuracy is high","flow":true},{"text":"The [c][cc0011]accuracy[-][/c] of the tap: the higher the quality is the higher Fever point and Score you will get","flow":true},{"text":"Tap when the middle of the note [c][cc0011]reaches[-][/c] the line in bottom of the screen tapping too [c][cc0011]early[-][/c] or too [c][cc0011]late[-][/c] will lower the quality","flow":true}],"layout":"recovered-content"},{"width":656,"height":962,"background":"/assets/img-guides/img_guide_bg.png","nodes":[{"text":"Type of Notes","flow":true},{"text":"Normal","flow":true},{"text":"Tap when the middle of the note reaches the line in bottom of the screen","flow":true},{"text":"Line","flow":true},{"text":"[c][cc0011]Tap and hold[-][/c] when the first note drops [c][cc0011]release[-][/c] when the second note drops","flow":true},{"text":"Combo","flow":true},{"text":"Tap both of the button when the note drops [c][cc0011]rapidly[-][/c] in a period of time the quality will be higher if it's tapped from more times.","flow":true}],"layout":"recovered-content"}]},"jump_game_window":{"name":"JumpGame","pages":[{"width":656,"height":962,"background":"/assets/img-guides/img_guide_bg.png","nodes":[{"src":"/assets/img-guides/img_guide_jump_game_icon1_en_en.png","flow":true},{"text":"Valeera will [c][cc0011]recover[-][/c] intellect after landing on a platform. The game will end when intellect reaches zero","flow":true},{"text":"Valeera will lose a lot of intellect if she touches the [c][cc0011]spikes[-][/c]","flow":true},{"text":"Provides [c][cc0011]extra[-][/c] points","flow":true},{"text":"Tap two sides of the screen to control Valeera","flow":true}],"layout":"recovered-content"},{"width":656,"height":962,"background":"/assets/img-guides/img_guide_bg.png","nodes":[{"text":"Platform Types","flow":true},{"text":"No effec